nd injection via buffer loading and pasting from the `.webterminal` directory, which is the communication method. Twelve external directories are connected to specific Tmux windows, with the principal agent running in `/home/azureuser`.\n\n\nThe system's operational context is established, with specific Tmux windows dedicated to various projects.  The mechanism for injecting commands from WhatsApp to the agent is clarified; messages are received by a script, then pasted into the appropriate Tmux window as input. The reverse stream, agent to WhatsApp, is handled through the WhatsApp bridge, providing output.\n\n\n"}
